  "question": {
    "text": "If the locus of the complex number&nbsp;<math><mi>z</mi></math> given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ar</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> is an arc of a circle, then the length of the arc is",
    "image": null
  },
