  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the given locus is a circle with centre <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/85ad140b-a726-4e87-880c-620cb638854c.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.79375in;height:1.52014in\" /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi></mi></math> Length of the arc of the circle is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units</p>",
